    <h1>Privacy Policy for iOS Calculator Pro</h1>

    <p class="date">
        <strong>Last Updated:</strong> November 9, 2026
    </p>

    <p>
        Welcome to <strong>iOS Calculator Pro</strong>
        ("the Application", "we", "our", or "us").
        We are committed to respecting and protecting
        your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains our
        practices regarding data collection, use, and
        disclosure when you use our mobile application.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Zero Personal Data Collection</h2>

    <p>
        iOS Calculator Pro does not collect, transmit,
        store, sell, or share any personal information.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>No user accounts or registrations are required.</li>
        <li>We do not collect names, email addresses,
        phone numbers, location data, or device identifiers.</li>
        <li>We do not track your usage, keystrokes,
        calculation content, or browsing behavior.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Device-Local Data Storage</h2>

    <p>
        All calculation data and user preferences are
        kept exclusively on your local device.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Calculation History:</strong>
        Equations and results are saved locally in a
        secure SQLite database using Android Room.</li>

        <li><strong>Settings & Preferences:</strong>
        Dark/Light theme, Degrees/Radians mode,
        haptic feedback, key click sound, and decimal
        precision are stored locally.</li>

        <li><strong>Data Deletion:</strong>
        You can delete individual history items or
        clear all history using the Clear All History
        feature. Uninstalling the app removes local data.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        None of this data is sent to external servers
        or cloud services.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Device Permissions</h2>

    <p>
        The Application requests only the minimum
        permissions necessary for its intended utility.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>android.permission.VIBRATE:</strong>
        Used exclusively to provide tactile vibration
        when tapping calculator buttons.</li>

        <li>You can enable or disable haptic feedback
        in the Settings menu.</li>

        <li>This permission does not access personal data.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        The Application does NOT request access to your
        camera, microphone, contacts, storage/photos,
        precise location, or phone state.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Services & SDKs</h2>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>No Advertising:</strong>
        The app does not contain advertising SDKs
        or third-party ad networks.</li>

        <li><strong>No Analytics or Trackers:</strong>
        We do not use Google Analytics, Firebase Analytics,
        Crashlytics, or tracking pixels.</li>

        <li><strong>Offline Operation:</strong>
        The Application operates 100% offline.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Children's Privacy</h2>

    <p>
        Because iOS Calculator Pro does not collect
        personal data from users, we do not knowingly
        collect personal information from children
        under 13 (or under 16 in the European Union).
    </p>

    <h2>6. Security</h2>

    <p>
        Your data stays on your personal device and
        is protected by Android's application sandbox
        security model. Since no data is transmitted
        over the internet, your calculations remain
        private to you.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

    <p>
        We may update our Privacy Policy from time
        to time. Any changes will be posted on this
        page with an updated Last Updated date.
    </p>

